<title>USA: Thermolase to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Thermolase to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ThermoLase Corp said Friday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to $10 million of its common shares.</p>
<p>The repurchase program runs until April 25, 1998. ThermoLase said in a statement it will repurchase shares at prices the company considers attractive.  About $3 million currently remains under the company's previous authorization.</p>
<p>The company has about 40.6 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
